00:26:13.950 --> 00:26:14.810
I mean collaborate.

00:26:14.810 --> 00:26:15.230
I mean collaborate.

00:26:15.230 --> 00:26:16.550
AJA HAMMERLY: Yeah, I don't
think insulting each other is

00:26:16.550 --> 00:26:18.230
